{"4129760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cutlery Warriors - The corroded kingdom", "steam_appid": 4129760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129760/extras/69f87175a43fe11fae61977d6aba25ec.poster.avif?t=1776265602\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129760/extras/69f87175a43fe11fae61977d6aba25ec.webm?t=1776265602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a kingdom consumed by rust, three unlikely heroes—armed only with kitchen utensils—must battle their way through a decaying world to restore light and beauty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players explore three vast regions, solving puzzles, <strong>discovering new abilities</strong>, and battling enemies in a <strong>strategic turn-based system</strong> where <strong>combining attacks unlocks powerful synergies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129760/extras/90de4655b2104a1d51bdfe4cb2142d74.poster.avif?t=1776265602\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129760/extras/90de4655b2104a1d51bdfe4cb2142d74.webm?t=1776265602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129760/extras/90de4655b2104a1d51bdfe4cb2142d74.mp4?t=1776265602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ <strong>Combo-Based Combat:</strong> Master a rhythm-driven <strong>attack chaining system</strong> where timing is key to maximizing damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129760/extras/5b348c053fdbb97c3b16d29c71f0aec6.poster.avif?t=1776265602\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129760/extras/5b348c053fdbb97c3b16d29c71f0aec6.webm?t=1776265602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129760/extras/5b348c053fdbb97c3b16d29c71f0aec6.mp4?t=1776265602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ <strong>Exploration-Based Progression:</strong> No grinding or leveling—<strong>unlock abilities by discovering secrets</strong> in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129760/extras/9a2b8f741d2e2bffe7f367deed33c989.avif?t=1776265602\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ <strong>Reactive NPCs &amp; Story:</strong> Your choices affect <strong>quests, NPC behavior, and the world’s state.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ✅ <strong>A Unique Fantasy World:</strong> Inspired by <i>Paper Mario</i>, <i>Hollow Knight</i>, and Studio Ghibli’s aesthetic.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129760/extras/69f87175a43fe11fae61977d6aba25ec.post